But I was in Baltimore.

714
00:34:11,299 --> 00:34:13,343
-Oh, Baltimore?
-Mmm-hmm.

715
00:34:13,426 --> 00:34:17,513
Yeah, I'm from South Dakota, so...
I struggled, too.

716
00:34:17,597 --> 00:34:19,099
I mean, I think that's why
I work so hard around here--

717
00:34:19,182 --> 00:34:22,560
Thank you, Gus,
for doing your job...

718
00:34:22,643 --> 00:34:24,019
that you get paid to do.

719
00:34:24,687 --> 00:34:26,522
[Gus chuckles] Okay.

720
00:34:26,606 --> 00:34:30,610
Hey, Connor? Uh, see if Liz
is around to talk wardrobe.

721
00:34:30,693 --> 00:34:33,196
Don't tell her I'm here,
just see if she's around.

722
00:34:33,279 --> 00:34:34,447
[continues typing]

723
00:34:34,530 --> 00:34:36,241
-Close that door for me, please.
-Uh-huh.

724
00:34:36,324 --> 00:34:37,617
Thank you.

725
00:34:38,743 --> 00:34:41,454
[Bertie] This is what I do.
[Mickey] Mmm.

726
00:34:41,537 --> 00:34:45,833
This way, the whole tub fills up
with syrup and you can just dip into it.

727
00:34:45,916 --> 00:34:47,627
Good idea.

728
00:34:48,628 --> 00:34:50,171
Sometimes it's fun to eat without limits.

729
00:34:50,255 --> 00:34:52,798
I'm just gonna eat this
whole thing tonight.

730
00:34:52,882 --> 00:34:56,219
Yeah, I mean, it's not like you can gain
ten pounds in one night.

731
00:34:56,302 --> 00:34:58,679
One pound, two pounds max.

732
00:34:58,763 --> 00:35:01,932
[humming, smacking lips]

733
00:35:04,018 --> 00:35:05,645
Oh, shit, I forgot to text Gus.

734
00:35:09,565 --> 00:35:12,652
See? This isn't hard at all.
I could totally drive a car.

735
00:35:12,735 --> 00:35:14,112
[cell phone chimes]

736
00:35:21,369 --> 00:35:23,037
Let's go find somewhere
where we can go really fast.

737
00:35:23,121 --> 00:35:25,206
Yes! Yeah.

738
00:35:25,290 --> 00:35:26,541
Floor this son of a bitch!

739
00:35:26,624 --> 00:35:29,919
Let's go, come on. Whoo!

740
00:35:30,002 --> 00:35:31,296
[Arya] Whoo!
[Gus] Whoo!

741
00:35:31,379 --> 00:35:33,381
[Arya] This is awesome.
[Gus] Yeah.

742
00:35:33,464 --> 00:35:35,466
[pop music playing]

